    "builder_system_DLwhq8": {
      "type": "builder-system",
      "blocks": {
        "card_CznQTH": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li>Small but mighty algae is super food but for your skin because </li><li>Super ingredient known for it’s moisture locking properties. Studies have shown microalgae extracts to stimulate collagen production leaving your skin looking hydrated and firmer. Plus it’s rich in antioxidants helping combat free radicals that accelerate aging and skin damage.</li></ul>",
            "tag_thumbnail_1": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2024-05-04_at_6.42.18_PM.png",
            "tag_1": "Microalgae Oil",
            "tag_2": "",
            "tag_3": ""
          }
        },
        "card_UzGHJp": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li>We formulate with vegan Squalane derived from sugarcane, where as traditional squalene comes from shark livers - harming hundreds of thousands of sharks each year. </li><li><strong>Our vegan, bio-based formula supports a healthy skin microbiome while leaving your skin silky smooth.</strong></li></ul>",
            "tag_thumbnail_1": "shopify://shop_images/squalane.jpg",
            "tag_1": "Neossance™ Vegan Shark Squalane",
            "tag_2": "",
            "tag_3": ""
          }
        },
        "card_46jfgR": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li>Basically magic. Mycosporine like amino-acids (MAA) hail from powerful macroalgae called Nori only found all the way in Japan! </li><li><strong>Clinically proven to reduce sunburn cell formation and keep you safe from UV rays longer.</strong></li></ul>",
            "tag_thumbnail_1": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2024-05-04_at_6.48.46_PM.png",
            "tag_1": "Red Algae MAA Extract",
            "tag_2": "",
            "tag_3": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "card_CznQTH",
        "card_UzGHJp",
        "card_46jfgR"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "video": "shopify://files/videos/B-SILK™ _ SEQUENCE _ H264 (1).mp4",
        "hide_mute": true,
        "title": "BIO BASED INGREDIENTS THAT MAKE A DIFFERENCE",
        "description": "<p>We formulated the Freak Barrier Defense System™️specifically to defend and strengthen your skin microbiome and skin barrier. <strong>Meet the proprietary ingredients that set us apart. </strong></p>",
